# Ignore patterns for research/ only. They live here, not in the root
# .gitignore, because nothing outside research/ refers to it (README rule 6).

# heavy scan intermediates; small results/*.json artifacts ARE committed
**/cache/

# LaTeX build products (the .tex sources are committed; aux/log are rebuilt)
*.pdf
# ...except the deliverables, committed so they read on GitHub: the reports and
# the derivation ledgers the notebooks emit (build_reports.sh builds both)
!report_*.pdf
!derivations_*.pdf
*.aux
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
